Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.63,0:00:28.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You smoke, Teach?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.38,0:00:31.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Five days ago, a battle broke out in the Modello
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.33,0:00:36.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,between a number of Lylat and Galgad spies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.33,0:00:39.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our people were able to find the Lylat spies' corpses,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.33,0:00:42.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but we don't have any details on the\NGalgad team's specifics or whereabouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.92,0:00:44.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They've evaded our efforts to find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.54,0:00:47.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So wait, the place where Thea and the others are\Nis a total powder keg right now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.88,0:00:49.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.38,0:00:51.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have been so careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.13,0:00:52.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Under rare circumstances,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.42,0:00:56.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,cornered spies will turn to desperate acts of violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.83,0:01:01.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All we can do is pray that the others\Ndon't get dragged into the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.33,0:02:43.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.54,0:02:46.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm this girl's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.96,0:02:49.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Matilda Barbet...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.83,0:02:54.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, you're a technician for Mirakoff Heavy Industries,\Na machining company from the Lylat Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.00,0:02:55.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've heard of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.63,0:02:59.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When their machines break down,\Nthey send techs out from Lylat to repair them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.67,0:03:00.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.67,0:03:03.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm here to service the hotel's fountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.71,0:03:06.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, what's this about you being Annette's mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.54,0:03:11.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Four years ago, we were visiting the Republic\Nwhen we ended up in a train crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.63,0:03:14.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They took me to the hospital…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.75,0:03:17.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I had no idea she actually survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.21,0:03:24.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So wait, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.21,0:03:25.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.42,0:03:27.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't get it, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.88,0:03:31.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Annette, go play with Erna.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.50,0:03:33.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now that, I get!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.25,0:03:35.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Erna, let's go have a squirt gun fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.67,0:03:38.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't want to.\NSomeone, save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.54,0:03:40.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Long story short,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.63,0:03:43.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,she's lost all her memories of\Neverything but the past four years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.33,0:03:49.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She got taken in by the state,\Ngiven the name Annette,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.08,0:03:52.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and left in the care of a seminary boarding school.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.50,0:03:55.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're her friends,\Nand we're all out on holiday together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.50,0:04:00.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to have to tell you,\Nbut Annette doesn't remember anything about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.21,0:04:01.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It can't be…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.25,0:04:05.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that we can't just nod along\Nand hand her over to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.38,0:04:09.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not to be rude, but there's no hard proof\Nthat you're actually her mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.63,0:04:12.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and we would have to consult with the school\Nbefore we did anything anyways.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.33,0:04:16.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, you're telling me that\Nmy daughter's lost her memories
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.08,0:04:19.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and has been living a completely different life\Nhere in the Republic?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.46,0:04:25.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, I should be thanking God for the fact\Nthat she's alive and that I got to see her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.88,0:04:27.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad she seems happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.63,0:04:31.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Has Annette always been such a wild child?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.42,0:04:32.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.42,0:04:36.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She would always sneak on to my job sites\Nand fiddle with the machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.88,0:04:39.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I never taught her how,\Nbut she soaked up information like a sponge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.92,0:04:43.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, that makes sense.\NSo, that's where she got her engineering skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.33,0:04:47.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We should leave.\NThe pool's closing soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.88,0:04:50.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.42,0:04:52.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know it's selfish of me to ask,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.75,0:04:56.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but would you let me have dinner with her tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.83,0:04:58.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.58,0:05:08.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Reading romance novels, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.04,0:05:10.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's intellectual curiosity, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.54,0:05:13.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Also, put on some clothes\Nbefore you come out on the balcony.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.50,0:05:15.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's fine. It's not like there's anyone around to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.75,0:05:17.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm literally right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.46,0:05:20.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I could bare it all, if you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.88,0:05:23.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I hate you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.92,0:05:29.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm planning on letting Matilda and Annette\Nsee each other tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.25,0:05:30.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Any objections?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.46,0:05:31.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why bother?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.67,0:05:33.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're just going to get split up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.29,0:05:35.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What good will letting them get attached do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.58,0:05:37.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She was so empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.08,0:05:41.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's how it felt when I looked into Annette's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.96,0:05:45.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She had no reason for wanting to be a spy\Nand no reason to want to stay on Lamplight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.17,0:05:48.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't see how my teammates'\Npersonal lives are my problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.71,0:05:50.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The team needs her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.79,0:05:53.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even I have to admit she's talented.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.71,0:05:55.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a perfect replica.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.33,0:05:58.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She made this for me\Nafter taking a single glance at my purse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.25,0:06:00.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It looks the exact same as the off-the-shelf model,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.71,0:06:03.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but if you give it a light flick…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.29,0:06:06.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,it tosses out these bouncy balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.83,0:06:10.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're made of metal coated in rubber,\Nso they can be used as throwing weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.21,0:06:15.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, I can carry three of them around with me\Nhidden in a unassuming purse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.25,0:06:16.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That Annette…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.29,0:06:18.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Her ability to memorize things is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.83,0:06:23.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pretty ironic, an amnesiac having a great memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.33,0:06:26.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm not expecting you to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.50,0:06:28.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All I ask is that you watch quietly from the side.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.17,0:06:31.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You want me to sit back and do nothing, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.38,0:06:34.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If that makes you feel like a hypocrite,\Nthen try this on for size.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.46,0:06:37.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If Annette finds a strong reason\Nfor wanting to be a spy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.50,0:06:40.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that could have huge benefits for Lamplight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.54,0:06:43.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fine, knock yourself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.21,0:06:45.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But I have two conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.96,0:06:47.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.58,0:06:49.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm coming to the dinner tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.83,0:06:54.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I need to make sure you don't get any funny ideas\Nabout handing Annette over to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.50,0:06:56.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's fine by me.\NWhat's your other condition?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.75,0:07:00.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You need to stay with those two\Nand make sure they don't embarrass me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.13,0:07:05.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm a mature adult lady,\Nso I want a dress that's cool and elegant, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.25,0:07:06.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.25,0:07:08.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don’t give a rat's ass what you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.33,0:07:10.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The jam went flying all over my dress!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.08,0:07:13.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't you move one more inch!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.17,0:07:49.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This should be interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.38,0:07:52.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,One of them has amnesia, sure,\Nbut they're still related.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.25,0:07:56.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to seeing how\Nshe gets through to Annette.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.96,0:07:57.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.96,0:08:00.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just hope they're able to get\Non the same wavelength.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.04,0:08:03.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.42,0:08:06.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Annette? Is that what your name is now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.21,0:08:07.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.92,0:08:09.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Have you been staying healthy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.13,0:08:10.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You haven't been getting hurt or sick, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.63,0:08:12.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm aces, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.21,0:08:13.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's so good to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.63,0:08:16.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was worried sick about you all last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.88,0:08:19.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh hey, samesies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.67,0:08:21.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You were concerned about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.67,0:08:25.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was worried about my health too, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.67,0:08:30.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's kind of scary how out of sync they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.50,0:08:40.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This just feels cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.71,0:08:43.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You really think she's going to want\NAnnette back after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.88,0:08:44.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.88,0:08:46.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Once the dessert comes, we should...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.21,0:08:49.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Erna?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.21,0:08:51.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I smell misfortune coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.29,0:08:55.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.71,0:09:05.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pretend you're getting up to go to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.46,0:09:06.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're going to slip out the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.08,0:09:13.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,May I ask what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.46,0:09:15.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Keep your voice down and follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.21,0:09:17.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Careful there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.42,0:09:18.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, ma'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.67,0:09:20.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.29,0:09:22.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think I had a bit too much to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.71,0:09:25.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here, I'll walk you back to your table.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.21,0:09:27.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's really not necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.04,0:09:29.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let me stay like this for a second, and I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.79,0:09:38.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There are three shady-looking men.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.54,0:09:42.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They noticed you're not coming back,\Nand they're on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.21,0:09:47.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That wasn't on purpose!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.75,0:09:49.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.75,0:09:50.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.96,0:09:51.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.96,0:09:53.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to take her to the little girls' room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.50,0:10:00.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you know who they are?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.00,0:10:01.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No one respectable, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.79,0:10:03.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You need to hurry, or they'll catch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.46,0:10:06.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You say that, but there's nothing around here\Nbut sea and mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.83,0:10:08.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can you get rid of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.42,0:10:12.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I could, but I'd rather not fire my gun\Nthis close to the restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.38,0:10:15.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just run along the side of the cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.25,0:10:16.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Follow the sound of the bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.79,0:10:17.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.79,0:10:18.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.88,0:10:19.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.46,0:10:20.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,O-okay.\N{\rSubtitle}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.33,0:10:26.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There! She ran that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.46,0:10:28.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't let her get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.67,0:10:29.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's got a friend with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.88,0:10:31.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Snag 'em both!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.38,0:10:43.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I sent an assassin on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.75,0:10:48.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,One who breaks all the rules and\Ncan bury her foes without a single weapon,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.63,0:10:51.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,or letting them sense a whiff of hostility.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.00,0:10:52.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How unlucky…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.46,0:10:56.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm code name Fool,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.67,0:10:58.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and it's time to kill with everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.42,0:11:15.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you being hunted?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.00,0:11:17.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.29,0:11:21.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Unless you tell me what's going on,\NI can't let you see Annette anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.54,0:11:25.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're debt collectors.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.08,0:11:26.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do elaborate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.13,0:11:29.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It all started two days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.00,0:11:32.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was taking a breather in the park\Nafter finishing up a job,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.29,0:11:35.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but when I set down my toolbox,\Nsomeone came and stole it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.29,0:11:38.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I looked everywhere I could,\Nbut they'd already sold it to a pawnshop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.79,0:11:40.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's when I panicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.67,0:11:43.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I put up my passport as collateral to borrow money
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.46,0:11:45.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I could gamble enough to buy it back, but I lost big.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.67,0:11:47.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.58,0:11:50.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just forget the dumb toolbox and go home without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.88,0:11:54.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But there are really important things in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.67,0:11:56.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Some mom she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.46,0:11:58.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She can't hold a decent conversation\Nwith her own daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.58,0:12:00.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and on top of that, she's loaded with debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.21,0:12:02.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I say we dump her off at the embassy\Nand be done with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.71,0:12:04.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come on, keep your voice down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.71,0:12:07.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It isn't Matilda's fault she got robbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.21,0:12:08.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.96,0:12:10.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This girl is an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.96,0:12:12.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Say what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.17,0:12:15.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There I was, in the depths of despair,\Nand she came to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.25,0:12:17.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She looked just a glittering angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.17,0:12:21.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I thought my daughter was dead,\Nbut now, we've been reunited.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.08,0:12:23.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What would you call that, if not a miracle?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.54,0:12:26.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All I want is to live together with my daughter again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.29,0:12:29.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please, let me have that second chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.50,0:12:31.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,See, now she's just talking nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.75,0:12:33.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've seen it, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.83,0:12:35.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Annette?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.42,0:12:39.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The toolbox was cobalt blue,\Nlike the color of the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.83,0:12:43.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Someone used to carry it around so proudly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.88,0:12:45.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are your memories coming back?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.33,0:12:50.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But back then, it was so large, and so heavy,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.00,0:12:52.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and so hard, and so close…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.75,0:13:03.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nope, I can't remember a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.63,0:13:07.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Matilda...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.21,0:13:11.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Would you mind if I went\Nand got that toolbox back for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.58,0:13:39.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What? Did you come to stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.83,0:13:43.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no need to help her out like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.67,0:13:46.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is the reward really worth all this risk?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.46,0:13:47.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I told you already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.17,0:13:51.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to fill up Annette's empty heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.17,0:13:54.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And what if doing that makes her\Nstop wanting to be a spy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.58,0:13:57.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then Annette can go back to being a normal girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.33,0:13:59.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Monika?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.58,0:14:00.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There are too many soldiers around.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.92,0:14:02.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's been bothering me all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.83,0:14:05.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They've been prowling the city since this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.75,0:14:07.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't you think that's weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.04,0:14:08.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you getting at?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.42,0:14:11.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Something messy is going down\Nright here in this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.92,0:14:13.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You still sure you want to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.75,0:14:14.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.42,0:14:16.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You really are an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.33,0:14:18.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And after that hit you took this afternoon, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.96,0:14:22.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you'd taken the radio, given the orders yourself,\Nand left Matilda to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.92,0:14:24.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that all would have gone a whole lot smoother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.50,0:14:26.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was the one who put us in that situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.38,0:14:30.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I couldn't let someone else shoulder all the danger,\Nand the same is true here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.83,0:14:32.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Like I said, you're an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.96,0:14:36.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And when you get hurt, it makes me\Nlook like I'm not doing my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.33,0:14:38.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, I'll lend you a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.25,0:14:41.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You really-
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.25,0:14:43.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come on, take a hint.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.21,0:14:45.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've got my ego to uphold,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.08,0:14:48.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and when my teammates get injured,\Nit reflects badly on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.08,0:14:52.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you're not willing to stand down,\Nthen what choice do I have?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.33,0:14:55.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just this once, I'll play along with\Nyour goody-two-shoes nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.88,0:14:59.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm here to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.38,0:15:01.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Me too, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.96,0:15:04.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All right, let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.75,0:15:06.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,With the four of us together, there's nothing we can't-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.75,0:15:08.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please, you can skip the big speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.25,0:15:11.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're gonna cooperate our way,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.92,0:15:14.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and we're gonna do it with the pride of knowing\Nthat we were the chosen ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.08,0:15:30.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.96,0:15:34.54,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,A regular old toolbox would never\Nsell at a price that high.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.25,0:15:38.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, I have something I'd like to sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.21,0:15:39.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Would you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.83,0:15:42.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.79,0:15:44.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's this toolbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.13,0:15:45.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Would you buy it from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.63,0:15:46.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.08,0:15:52.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This toolbox is the exact same\Nas the one over in the display case there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.17,0:15:55.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Would you be willing to give me\Nseventy percent of the sale price?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.46,0:16:00.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I memorized everything about it, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.88,0:16:03.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Gimme an hour, and I'll have it finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.33,0:16:04.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.13,0:16:08.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,H-how can it be the exact same?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.42,0:16:09.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can you help us out?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.96,0:16:12.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was really precious to her father.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.79,0:16:16.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Be that as it may, my hands are tied.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.67,0:16:21.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please, sir, we really need the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.71,0:16:23.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.96,0:16:31.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is the hotel we're staying at.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.71,0:16:33.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't hesitate to give me a call\Nif you change your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.33,0:16:36.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.88,0:16:38.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.33,0:16:41.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Go on ahead back to the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.29,0:16:43.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll be there as soon as I'm done with my shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.08,0:16:44.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.17,0:16:47.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is Dreamspeaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.42,0:16:49.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stage one is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.17,0:16:51.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I saw right through that shopkeeper's desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.75,0:16:55.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's a money-grubber, just like we suspected.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.50,0:16:56.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.50,0:16:57.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is Fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.71,0:16:59.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stage two is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.33,0:17:01.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The toolbox got stolen, just like we planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.83,0:17:05.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That means the pawnshop and the thieves\Nare definitely in cahoots.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.29,0:17:06.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Still, that was fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.54,0:17:10.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It disappeared while I was distracted\Nby a fountain show.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.33,0:17:12.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're like a pickpocket's wet dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.71,0:17:16.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it,\NI think my purse is missing, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.08,0:17:19.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Annette, how's that transmitter looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.46,0:17:22.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's working like a charm!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.13,0:17:23.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And it's pretty close, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.54,0:17:24.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.54,0:17:25.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can you give me the coordinates?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.63,0:17:45.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Looks like a couple of lowlifes who\Ncouldn't hack it as a real gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.38,0:17:48.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, that's fine by me.\NTime to finish this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.75,0:17:56.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, you steal valuables from tourists,\Nsell them to that pawnshop,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.25,0:17:59.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,put them up for outrageous prices,\Nlend money to your desperate marks,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.25,0:18:01.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and direct them to your casinos?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.21,0:18:03.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is one messed-up operation you're running.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.71,0:18:05.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.25,0:18:07.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just a girl on vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.00,0:18:10.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's a whole lot of passports\Nyou've snatched up as collateral.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.04,0:18:15.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yep, figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.67,0:18:17.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hands off the merch!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.83,0:18:19.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow, rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.75,0:18:27.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd be happy to take you all out myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.46,0:18:29.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but this time, I'm handing off the honors.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.17,0:18:32.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yo, is it my time to shine?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.63,0:18:35.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm code name Forgetter,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.38,0:18:37.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and it's time to put it all together, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.21,0:18:55.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How were you able to get it back?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.38,0:18:57.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who exactly are you all?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.96,0:19:00.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have a relative on the force.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.50,0:19:02.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All I did was ask them to do me a little favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.71,0:19:07.71,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Actually, we used that secret ledger we stole\Nto blackmail the shop owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.08,0:19:09.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I am sorry, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.63,0:19:12.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We weren't able to find your passport.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.21,0:19:13.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's a shame…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.42,0:19:16.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Forget that stuff!\NShow me what's inside, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.46,0:19:18.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sure, I would be happy to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.75,0:19:22.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've been looking forward to this so much,\NI couldn't sleep last night!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.96,0:19:27.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to make sure that only the right people\Nget caught in my traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.33,0:19:29.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How can I do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.42,0:19:30.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You mean, when you're pulling pranks?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.96,0:19:33.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, you could try using this paint.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.08,0:19:34.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ooh, how does it work?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.46,0:19:36.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a new kind of paint we just developed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.25,0:19:38.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It dissolves when it gets wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.21,0:19:41.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maybe you could try only telling your friends\Nhow to tell it apart from other paint.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.38,0:19:42.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.38,0:19:43.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This, I can get behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.88,0:19:47.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's probably how they used to communicate,\Nback before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.83,0:19:50.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's something I should say, for the record.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.17,0:19:53.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I hate Annette's guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.96,0:19:54.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.96,0:19:58.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?!\NShe always bullies me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.92,0:20:00.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.54,0:20:01.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.96,0:20:04.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,it would still make me sad if she left.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.46,0:20:09.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please, don't get the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.46,0:20:13.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't think that woman would\Nmake a very good mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.25,0:20:16.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If Annette wants to go live with Matilda,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.29,0:20:18.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll do everything I can to talk her out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.46,0:20:19.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeep?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.67,0:20:23.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But if she truly makes up her mind to go,\Nthen that's her choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.38,0:20:29.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think that's a very noble way\Nto approach things, Big Sis Thea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.83,0:20:31.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.83,0:20:34.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And can you tell what this part is?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.46,0:20:36.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I wonder?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.46,0:20:55.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, this is what having a mom is like.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.33,0:21:04.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna try this out on Erna first, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.58,0:21:07.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I changed my mind.\NPlease leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.13,0:21:08.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good work, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.54,0:21:09.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You too, Monika.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.79,0:21:13.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Matilda was over the moon,\Nand it's all thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.42,0:21:17.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We should probably go ahead\Nand tell Klaus about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.50,0:21:19.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wonder how Teach will react?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.58,0:21:21.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm a little scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.92,0:21:25.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nah, I'd say those specific fears are misguided.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.58,0:21:26.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.92,0:21:28.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It smelled fishy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.58,0:21:30.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The army was descending on the city,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.25,0:21:33.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and that woman refused to go to the cops\Nafter she got her stuff stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.38,0:21:35.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I checked out my hunch,\Nand sure enough, it was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.83,0:21:38.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I found Matilda's passport.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.29,0:21:40.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The thing is, it had a different name on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.33,0:21:44.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You liar, you told us you never found it at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.38,0:21:47.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've been spending the past day investigating\Nto make absolutely sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.21,0:21:48.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.50,0:21:51.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have gotten to the\Nbottom of this if not for you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.46,0:21:54.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The fact is, Matilda's an Imperial spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.67,0:21:59.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll go ahead and report in to Klaus.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.13,0:22:09.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After all, we've got a responsibility to\Nhand Matilda over to the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.46,0:02:39.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(422.4,568.8)}{\an7}Modello Entertainment District -
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.46,0:02:39.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(294.4,619.2)}{\an7}Four Days Before the Others Began Their Search
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.33,0:02:44.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(870.4,619.2)}{\an7}MISSION: Forgetter II
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.08,0:13:21.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(243.2,547.2)}{\an7}MISSION: Forgetter II
